@baseUrl = https://iam.example.test/api/v1
@clientId = replace-with-registered-oa-client
@keyId = replace-with-current-key-id

### OA01 GRANT
# D 生产服务认证尚未交付，当前默认 INVALID_SERVICE。
# timestamp/nonce/signature 必须由真实服务签名客户端生成，不能把示例值当可信凭据。
# 每次 HTTP 请求使用新 nonce；签名包含实际路径、查询串与此原始 body 的摘要。
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/oa/decisions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Id: {{clientId}}
X-Key-Id: {{keyId}}
X-Request-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Request-Nonce: {{nonce}}
X-Request-Signature: {{signature}}

{
  "sourceSystem": "OA",
  "eventId": "OA-C2-04-GRANT-001",
  "approvalId": "APPR-C2-04-001",
  "approvalStatus": "APPROVED",
  "operation": "GRANT",
  "targetUserId": "101",
  "roleId": "5",
  "approvedAt": "2026-10-19T10:00:00+08:00"
}

### REVOKE by source ID (use a new nonce/signature)
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/oa/decisions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Id: {{clientId}}
X-Key-Id: {{keyId}}
X-Request-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Request-Nonce: {{nonce}}
X-Request-Signature: {{signature}}

{
  "sourceSystem": "OA",
  "eventId": "OA-C2-04-REVOKE-001",
  "approvalId": "REVOKE-APP-C2-04-001",
  "approvalStatus": "APPROVED",
  "operation": "REVOKE",
  "targetUserId": "101",
  "roleId": "5",
  "approvedAt": "2026-10-19T11:00:00+08:00",
  "grantSourceId": "{{grantSourceId}}"
}

### REVOKE by original approval (grantSourceId must be absent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/oa/decisions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Id: {{clientId}}
X-Key-Id: {{keyId}}
X-Request-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Request-Nonce: {{nonce}}
X-Request-Signature: {{signature}}

{
  "sourceSystem": "OA",
  "eventId": "OA-C2-04-REVOKE-002",
  "approvalId": "REVOKE-APP-C2-04-002",
  "approvalStatus": "APPROVED",
  "operation": "REVOKE",
  "targetUserId": "101",
  "roleId": "5",
  "approvedAt": "2026-10-19T11:00:00+08:00",
  "originalApprovalId": "APPR-C2-04-001"
}

# 同事件同内容：新 nonce 重新签名后重发原 body，APPLIED 结果重放且不增 revision/成功审计。
# 同事件不同内容：409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT；不同事件同审批：复用来源、不增 revision。
# 非批准/字段不完整/错误引用组合：400；服务身份错误：401；超范围/超级角色：403。
# PROCESSING：409；PENDING_RECOVERY 或完整性/审计依赖不可用：503；没有在线接管入口。
